OL,3,GNEWSAMillions of pounds of council's
OL,4,ASEND debts being wiped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has agreed to write-off
OL,7,Fhundreds of millions of pounds of a
OL,8,Fcouncil's debts.
OL,10,FIt is part of the #5bn Higher Needs
OL,11,FStability Grant to councils that have
OL,12,Foverspent on Special Educational Needs
OL,13,Fand Disabilities (SEND).
OL,15,FBCP (Bournemouth Christchurch and
OL,16,FPoole) Council will have more than
OL,17,F#165m of its SEND debt wiped - but
OL,18,Faccepts it has to improve its provision
OL,19,Fin future.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
